  "facts": [
    "The Girard Point Bridge, a double‑decked cantilevered truss, opened in 1973 to carry Interstate 95 across Philadelphia’s Schuylkill River.",
    "In 2010–2011, Buckley and Co. milled the deck, poured a new surface, and painted the structural steel to extend the bridge’s life.",
